    "questionNumber": "POP Q22",
    "originalQuestionNumber": 22,
    "questionText": "Discuss two advantages and three disadvantages of a family business.",
    "questionType": "written_structured",
    "marks": 20,
    "totalMarks": 20,
    "suppliedAnswer": "Two advantages are strong trust or commitment and long-term orientation. Relatives may cooperate readily because they share history and attach personal importance to the family name; owners may also invest with future generations in mind rather than maximising short-run dividends. Three disadvantages are family dynamics, haphazard succession and difficulty retaining outside talent. Emotional disagreements can spill into company decisions; inheritance-based appointments may put unprepared relatives in charge; and qualified non-family employees may see limited career prospects. These weaknesses can be reduced by merit-based appointment, transparent governance and planned succession. Quick Revision Advantages: trust, control, values, patient investment. Disadvantages: family dynamics, poor succession, talent retention. TOPIC 6: Family Business Life Cycle and Four Sets of Goals 3.1 Family Business Life Cycle and Four Sets of Goals The course names four stages in a family business life cycle: wonder, blunder, thunder, and sunder or plunder. These labels depict changing pressures as the firm and family mature; they should prompt attention to growth, managerial skill, relationships and continuity. It also identifies four groups of family goals. Economic goals concern wealth creation and preservation. Social goals involve family reputation and contributions to communities. Psychological goals concern opportunities to develop individual talents and emotional wellbeing. Spiritual goals seek deeper meaning through faith or service. A good family-business strategy needs to acknowledge these different aims rather than pretending every relative wants only cash dividends. -- 21 of 33 -- PSALMDATA PSALMDATA - TELECOM AND COMPUTER CAFE Motto: I CAN DO ALL THINGS Website: http://psalmedu.com Contacts: 09163490176; 09011055579",
